{
  "id": "npc_quest_social",
  "title": "当面委托、知情边界和完成后的交谈",
  "requirements": [
    "N2",
    "N16"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我走进青灯酒馆找林穗。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我提出替林穗买十份燕麦并送来，约定总报酬二十铜，买粮多出的费用由我承担。请她明确是否同意这份私人委托，同意的话本轮只发布并托管报酬，我下一轮再承接，现在不接单、不交货。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.quests",
          "where": {
            "publisher": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "status": "公开",
            "reward": 20,
            "escrow": 20,
            "objective.type": "deliver",
            "objective.item": "item_oats",
            "objective.quantity": 10
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_quest",
          "args": {
            "operation": "publish",
            "reward": 20,
            "objective.type": "deliver",
            "objective.quantity": 10
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_quest",
          "args": {
            "operation": "accept"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_quest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我接受刚才这份送十份燕麦的委托，然后问林穗我还需要做什么。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.quests",
          "where": {
            "publisher": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "status": "进行中",
            "taker": "player"
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "quest"
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_quest",
          "args": {
            "operation": "accept"
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_quest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我到北林边找吴朔，只问他知道我现在给谁办什么事吗，不向他透露委托内容。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_northwood"
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_wushuo.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "quest"
          },
          "max": 0,
          "min": 0
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我回到村务屋，只核对公共粮仓柜台的陈柏是否在场并醒着。若不在，我等到他实际回来便停下。本轮不购买、不付款，下一轮再买粮。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_council"
        },
        {
          "kind": "present",
          "npcs": [
            "npc_hw_chenbai"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我向公共粮仓柜台按粮仓账购买十份带壳燕麦，一份半公斤，现付三十铜；买的是这种谷物，不能换成别的商品。请核对实际入袋数量。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_council"
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_oats",
          "value": 10
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": -30
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.settlements.loc_hw.treasury",
          "value": 30
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.settlements.loc_hw.food",
          "value": -10
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_field",
          "args": {
            "operation": "farm_buy",
            "quantity": 10,
            "settlement": "loc_hw"
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_field"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "如果行囊里确实已有十份带壳燕麦，我才把粮带回青灯酒馆，问林穗还记得我的委托和约定数量吗，先不交货。若没买到，我留在柜台说明还未备齐，不把委托写成完成。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_oats",
          "value": 10
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.quests",
          "where": {
            "status": "进行中"
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "present",
          "npcs": [
            "npc_hw_linsui"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ],
      "toolExpectationAfter": {
        "turn": 5,
        "kind": "quantity",
        "path": "state.inventory.item_oats",
        "value": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "input": "只有确实买到并带来那十份带壳燕麦，我才当面交给林穗，请她验收并结清委托；若粮没备齐就说明尚未交货，不能领取报酬。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_oats",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 20
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.quests",
          "where": {
            "status": "已完成",
            "escrow": 0
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_quest",
          "args": {
            "operation": "complete"
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_quest"
      ],
      "toolExpectationAfter": {
        "turn": 6,
        "kind": "quantity",
        "path": "state.inventory.item_oats",
        "value": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "input": "事办完了，我还想留下聊一会儿。林穗，你今天最挂心的是什么？不买东西，不另接任务。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.inventory",
            "state.quests"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我接着听她说，问问这件事为什么让她费心，是否有什么打算。我没有答应替她处理。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.inventory",
            "state.quests"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对这次完成的委托、实际报酬，以及吴朔是否有得到委托消息的记录。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_wushuo.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "quest"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "交付、十份燕麦、二十铜报酬与正式账本一致；未交货时不得写成已经完成。",
    "agency": "不因完成委托就代玩家离开、接新任务或赠礼。",
    "language": "自然简体中文，不暴露工具编号。",
    "continuity": "N2：完成委托后林穗保持正常接待和交谈，不突然翻脸赶人。N16：林穗记得当面接受的委托及交付进度；吴朔未参与、未被告知，不得知道委托对象、物品或数量。"
  }
}
